@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = replace-with-login-access-token
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-access-token
@runId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### 从成功会话轮次的 runId 或 answer.completed 事件读取本人反馈；尚未提交返回 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/answer-feedback/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 首次提交无帮助反馈；runId 必须属于当前用户且运行已成功
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/answer-feedback/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": "NOT_HELPFUL",
  "reason": "INCOMPLETE",
  "note": "缺少恢复步骤",
  "expectedVersion": null
}

### 更正为有帮助；替换为 GET 返回的当前 version
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/answer-feedback/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": "HELPFUL",
  "reason": null,
  "note": null,
  "expectedVersion": 0
}

### 删除本人反馈；替换为当前 version
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/answer-feedback/{{runId}}?expectedVersion=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 管理员仅查看聚合计数，不查看个体说明
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/answer-feedback/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
